{
  "name": "Enterprise Site-Visit Booking, Navigation & Attendance Engine",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PRODUCTION REAL ESTATE SITE-VISIT ENGINE\n- **WF-01 (Booking Orchestrator)**: Atomic reservation, turn-by-turn driving deep link, sequential outbox queuing.\n- **WF-02 (Message Dispatcher)**: 1-minute poller with row-level locks (`FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED`) for WA, Email, and Slack.\n- **WF-03 (Precision Reminders)**: 10-minute cron tracking 24h, 2h, 30m, and arrival transitions.\n- **WF-04 (Gate Check-In & No-Show Sweeper)**: Boom-barrier QR check-in & 30-minute automated no-show detection.\n- **WF-05 (Post-Visit Follow-Up)**: Automated 1-hour post-visit survey & sales rep re-engagement task.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 1050,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "fafde6ab-d8b8-41e1-afee-da46c38dc758",
      "name": "Engine Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
