        "query": "SELECT v.*, r.rep_name, r.phone_e164 AS rep_phone, p.name AS project_name, p.site_lat, p.site_lng\nFROM sitevisits.site_visits v\nJOIN sitevisits.reps r ON r.rep_id = v.rep_id\nJOIN sitevisits.projects p ON p.id = v.project_id\nWHERE v.status IN ('pending_confirmation', 'confirmed')\n  AND (\n    (v.scheduled_at - now() BETWEEN interval '23h50m' AND interval '24h10m' AND NOT v.reminder_24h_sent)\n    OR (v.scheduled_at - now() BETWEEN interval '1h50m' AND interval '2h10m' AND NOT v.reminder_2h_sent)\n    OR (v.scheduled_at - now() BETWEEN interval '20m' AND interval '40m' AND NOT v.reminder_30m_sent)\n    OR (v.scheduled_at - now() BETWEEN interval '-10m' AND interval '10m' AND NOT v.reminder_arrival_sent)\n  );",
